Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Spectators and duelists, Round One\Nhas come to a close and half of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,our super 16 competitors have been\Nsent home so now i give you the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,elite eight and first up it's our\Nboy wonder the undefeated leon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,wilson but someone's looking to take\Na bite out of leon's winning streak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So evacuate the beach and\Ncall in the Coast Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the man-eater, Ethan Sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the fancy intros.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to my duel already. That's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Always a model of patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you might want to take this\Ntime to run through your game strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Some last-minute studying couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey hates cramming, which is too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,because he's about to get schooled by that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,freakazoid who took out\NWeevil and Rex in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing I'm scared of\Nis that hairdo. Hey, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:02:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinky the Clown called\NHe wants his wig back Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,like you're in any position\Nto be making fun of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone's hairdo I heard that\NTake it down a notch, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too high-strung to duel\NWho are you calling high-strung?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cool as a cucumber Oh, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,real cool I'm not in the\Nmood You want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you two grow up for like five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some female friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He started it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I just have a case\Nof the pre-duel jitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't all be as calm as Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be too bad if you made\Nit to the final eight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta do what I do\Nand believe you're gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to win because then\NI'll have to face off against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it freaks me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, pal, just take this\None duel at a time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too soon to worry about\Nthe championship duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:03:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're gonna have to duel\Nagainst me before you can get to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just make sure you\Ngo easy on me, okay, Beck?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wheel of time, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Siegfried, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to wish you\Nluck out there today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I don't rely on luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to be nice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I come from, you show\Nyour opponent some respect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Siegfried, maybe you didn't hear me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the suit. Oh,\NI'll touch more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, Herr Joseph,\NI'd listen to my little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got news for you. You're not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I was, I'd be a worthless\Nstreet punk with no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And not to mention appalling\Ntaste in outerwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No one insults my fashion\Nsense and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wasted more than\Nenough time on you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me,\NI have a duel to win. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, save it for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he's\Ndealing with anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to beat the designer\Npants off of that chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He better get a grip or he's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The match didn't even start yet and Joey's\Nletting this guy mess with his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I should be\Nheading out to my match now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I know Joey really\Nneeds you out there to cheer him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means you won't\Nbe there to watch me duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart goes out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, there is a bright\Nside to this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to stay in this\Ntournament till the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll have plenty more\Nchances to root for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey's gonna need all the help he\Ncan get if he plans on beating Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to speak to you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So have you noticed any strange behavior\Ncoming from any of the competitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to promise not to tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If any word of this gets out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it could ruin the Grand Championship\Nand our whole company for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when the Dualtech computer went
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,berserk and locked us\Ninside the Kaiba Dome?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta relax, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until we find that hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the system secure now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I reinforced the\NKaiba Corp firewall,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one should be able to\Nbreak in from the outside again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about someone sabotaging\Nthis tournament from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling that the person\Nwe're after is already on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How could someone have snuck\Nin without us noticing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said they snuck in, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We invited them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I find out which one of\Nthose competitors is out to ruin me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,they're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm conducting\Nbackground checks on all duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm counting on you to keep an\Neye out for any suspicious activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who do you think it is, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the slightest clue,\Nand that's why I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me know if\Nyou notice anything strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you do realize that strange things\Nhappen to us all the time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was hoping this time\Nwould be different, but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so much for that huh just\Nonce i'd like to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,in a tournament for the\Nthrill of it and not have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,to worry about who's trying\Nto take over the world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,yuki please why can't\Nthings just be easy for a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,change we should be having\Nfun not hunting down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:07:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,bad guys don't worry\Nwe'll find him soon i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,not gonna let some punk ruin\Nthis tournament Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on us to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what do you say we get out there,\Nwatch Joey's duel, and do what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's never a dull moment, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The next four championship\Nbouts are now underway, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing off in the house of horror,\Nwhere the ghouls come to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Wonderboy Leon Wilson vs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Man-eater Ethan Sharpe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's showtime at\Nthe Kaivaland Theater,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,as the duelist detective\Nfaces the master of magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's move on to the Wheel of Wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,as the grand championship\Ntakes to the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:08:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In this bizarre match-up, regional champ\NRebecca Hawkins faces Abe the Monkey Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, if you can't stand the\Nheat, get out of the volcanic pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's here that\Ntrendsetter Siegfried
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lloyd squares off against\NJumpin' Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Love what you've done with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what do you say we get\Ndown to business, Ziggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're here for you, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now raucous world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,About time you guys showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.09,0:08:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,May the best dress duelist win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you shaking in\Nyour patent leather shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And the whole world's gonna see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're shuffled,\Nso quit stalling, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Takes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for keeping his cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just stay calm, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, don't touch the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to roll up those\Nfrilly sleeves and get dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I won't even break a sweat on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Herr Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're clearly at a\Ndisadvantage in so many ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you make the first move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just messing with your head, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:09:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I wonder if he's got a bad hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't play a single monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beginning to sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the molten lava getting to\Nyou, or is it something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all he's gonna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that's all\Nhe can play No, I can't watch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it's done. So\Nwatch and learn. I'll start
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,by activating a magic card\NGraceful charity This lets
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,me draw three cards As\Nlong as I discard two And
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll wrap things up by\Nplacing one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Siegfried doesn't have\Nsuch a great hand either Oh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we had nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange I don't trust\Nthat guy Something tells
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,me that he's setting up\NJoey for some kind of a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope Joey figures it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually thought you might\Nwin in one move like you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,did last time But you couldn't\Neven summon a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even summon a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be on to\Nme by now, Herr Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you just need a little hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, allow me to shake things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to turn up the heat! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a little too realistic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why don't you turn down the flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,One small problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't part of the\Nattraction, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaiba Corp's not controlling\Nthose flames, then who is, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be top banana,\Nyou've got to stop monkeying around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, monkey, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you're the smart one, pal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm clued into your strategy, Balfrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This house, it's haunted. For\Nreal. Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we're experiencing technical\Ndifficulties Please stand by
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we've got trouble I'm\Non it How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire Unity system is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Virus alert! Virus alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I secured the entire\Nnetwork after the last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way someone\Ncould break in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a computer genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that cyber geek Rebecca Hawkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not even she could pull off\Nsomething of this magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person I know who could\Naccomplish a brilliant scheme like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the invitation, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you know, your son\NSeto is the talk of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe me, I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My son, too, is a child prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you're about as\Nthrilled to be here as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we spice things up a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights are flat. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a short.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mainframe is infected, sir. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,there must be some mistake\NCheck it again The KC mainframe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is protected by a fail-safe\Nsystem No one can get in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I dabble in technology.\NI guess when you spend all your time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,alone You tend to tinker in your own little\Nprojects You know how it is, Herr Kaidan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess now's as good a time as any\Nto try and get my A-game back on track
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Brigadier of\NLandstar in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I think I'll juice him up with\Na magic card known as Landstar Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:15:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does this card\Ngive my Brigadier a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,fancy new musket It\Nboosts his power by 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, little buddy,\Nshow him what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Siegfried directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire, you little munchkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a truss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.49,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Wotan's Judgment, and\Nit stops your attack instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because it lets me\Nswitch any magic card I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,in my hand with the top card\Nof my deck and resupple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you consider your A-games,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're not going\Nto last too much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or is it getting hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make your move, wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, someone's all fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this will cool you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I slay Pot of Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can draw two additional\Ncards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I play Erda's Guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As the goddess of knowledge, she\Ncontrols the past, present and future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The hand is the future, the field is the\Npresent and the graveyard is the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, thanks to my Fraulein friend, I can\Nmove one card from my hand to my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And in exchange, I can transfer one\Ntrap from the grave to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He went through all of that\Njust to play some trap card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll do for now. That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even going to summon a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever Siegfried's\Nstrategy is, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the second time he\Nleft himself wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Siegfried is just\Nwaiting for the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that magic card he\Nplayed in his last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the one he used to\Nbeat Rex and Weevil in one turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're watching here, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So enjoy the show while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because soon it will be curtains for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you noticed,\Nbut the duel's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can at least have the courtesy to look\Nat me when I'm about to kick your butt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,wise guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot you were standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But with an opponent as dull and\Nforgettable as you, can you blame me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling you is about as\Ninteresting as watching grass grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So this duel's too boring for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just have to make\Nthings more interesting, won't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my Brigadier of\NLandstar so I can summon Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my Jinzo special ability,\Nall of your trap cards are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jinzo, attack this chunk directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask that for a little excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you'll show\NJoey Wheeler some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not just another pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's showing him, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You the man, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've embarrassed\Nyou enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead, Ziggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You were much better off\Nwhen I was ignoring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now you've gotten my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So not only will I defeat you,\Nbut I'll send you down in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Und it all begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:18:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This card should look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same one I used to\Ndevastate the last two fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not that! We were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride of the Valkyries!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid your end\Nis only the beginning.
